# Scratch run output (backfill/server logs written during ad-hoc work).
# Matched at any depth so frontend/scratch_*.log is covered too. Deliberately
# not committed: they go stale immediately, and the .prod.log ones carry
# production backfill output that would live in git history permanently.
scratch_*.log
**/scratch_*.log
